{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 PT2Reaper\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Pro Tools style editing for REAPER: one REAPER action per Pro Tools command, named after the Pro Tools command (Action List: search "Pro Tools").\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Highlights\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge: clip / clip start / end / contents / selection / play, by the Nudge value of the Grid Nudge Panel (Pro Tools Nudge presets: Measure, Min:Secs, Timecode, Feet+Frames, Samples).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Edit selection: Tab to Transient, Move / Extend / Shrink Edit Selection, Double / Halve, Separate Clip (at selection, on grid, at transients), Trim, Clear / Delete with partial fades.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Fades: Create Fades, Delete Fades, fade shapes, crossfades.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Transport: Play/Stop, Play Half Speed, Insertion Follows Playback, QuickPunch and Record Punch (punch in / out while playing; the pass records in the background on hidden "QP buffer" tracks).\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 How to use\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nothing is bound automatically. A good way: put the Pro Tools keys in an alternate keymap section (Action List > Section: "Main (alt-1)") and switch with "Main action section: Toggle override to alt-1", so your own REAPER keys stay untouched.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab The Grid Nudge Panel shows and sets the Grid and Nudge values.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Requirements\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab REAPER 7.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab js_ReaScriptAPI (optional): the Grid Nudge Panel gives the keyboard focus back to the arrange view after a click.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Credits\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Transport (Play/Stop, Play Half Speed, Insertion Follows Playback): behaviour modelled on TJF Scripts by Tim Farrell (github.com/sonictim/TJF-Scripts).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Pro Tools is a trademark of Avid Technology; this project is not affiliated with Avid.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Built with AI: written with Claude Code (Anthropic); designed and tested by hsuanice.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Suggested shortcuts (Pro Tools keys)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Apply Next Fade Shape: Opt+Control+Right\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Apply Previous Fade Shape: Opt+Control+Left\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Change Edit to Match Timeline - End: Cmd+Shift+Control+0\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Change Edit to Match Timeline - Start: Opt+Shift+Control+0\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Change Edit to Match Timeline: Control+0, 0\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Change Timeline to Match Edit - End: Cmd+Shift+Control+O\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Change Timeline to Match Edit - Start: Opt+Shift+Control+O\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Change Timeline to Match Edit: Control+O, O\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Clear: Cmd+B\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Consolidate Selection: Opt+#, Opt+Shift+NumPad 3\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Copy and Move Clip End To Current TC: Opt+Control+I\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Copy and Move Clip End To Play Position: Opt+Control+K\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Copy and Move Clip Start To Current TC: Opt+Control+Y\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Copy and Move Clip Start To Play Position: Opt+Control+H\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Copy and Move Clip Sync Point To Current TC: Opt+Control+U\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Copy and Move Clip Sync Point To Play Position: Opt+Control+J\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Create Fades: Cmd+F\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Decrease Grid Value: _, Opt+Control+NumPad -\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Decrease Nudge Value: Cmd+Opt+NumPad -, Opt+_, Cmd+Opt+-\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Delete Selection: Delete, Backspace\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Double Edit Selection: Cmd+Opt+Control+"\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Duplicate: Cmd+D\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Edit Lock Clip: Cmd+L\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Execute Crossfade using last setting: Cmd+Control+F, Control+F, F\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Extend Edit Insertion Down: :, Control+:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Extend Edit Insertion Up: Shift+P, Shift+Control+P\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Fade In From Start To Cursor: D, Control+D\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Fade Out From Cursor To End: Control+G, G\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Grid Mode: Opt+4, F4\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Group Clips: Cmd+Opt+G\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Halve Edit Selection: Cmd+Opt+Shift+Control+L\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Heal Separation: Cmd+H\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Identify Sync Point: Cmd+,\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Increase Grid Value: +, Opt+Control+NumPad +\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Increase Nudge Value: Opt++, Cmd+Opt+NumPad +, Cmd+Opt+=\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Input Monitor Tracks with an Edit Selection: Shift+I\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Insertion Follows Playback: N, Control+N\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Link Timeline and Edit Selection: Shift+NumPad /, ?\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Link Track And Edit Selection: Shift+T\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Loop Clips: Cmd+Opt+L\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Mouse - Double-Click Selects Gap Between Clips: Mouse: double-click empty track space\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Mouse - Shift-Click Extends Edit Selection: Mouse: Shift+click\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Mouse - Shift-Double-Click Extends Edit Selection Over Gap: Mouse: Shift+double-click empty track space\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Clip End To Current TC: Control+I, I\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Clip End To Play Position: K, Control+K\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Clip Start To Current TC: Control+Y, Y\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Clip Start To Play Position: Control+H, H\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Clip Sync Point To Current TC: Control+U, U\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Clip Sync Point To Play Position: J, Control+J\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Insertion Down: ;, Control+;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Insertion To Next Edit - Extend Selection: ", Control+", Shift+Tab\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Insertion To Next Edit: ', Control+', Tab\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Insertion To Previous Edit - Extend Selection: Shift+Control+L, Opt+Shift+Tab, Shift+L\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Insertion To Previous Edit: L, Control+L, Opt+Tab\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Insertion To Session End - Extend Selection: Opt+Shift+Return\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Insertion To Session End: Opt+Return\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Insertion To Session Start - Extend Selection: Shift+Return\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Insertion To Song Start: Shift+Control+Return\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Insertion Up: P, Control+P\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Selection To Next Clip - Extend Selection: Cmd+Control+", Shift+Control+Tab\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Selection To Next Clip: Cmd+Control+', Control+Tab\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Selection To Previous Clip - Extend Selection: Opt+Shift+Control+Tab, Cmd+Shift+Control+L\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Move Edit Selection To Previous Clip: Opt+Control+Tab, Cmd+Control+L\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Mute Tracks with an Edit Selection: Shift+M\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Mute Unmute Clip: Cmd+M\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Clip Contents Earlier By Grid: Control+NumPad -\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Clip Contents Later By Grid: Control+NumPad +\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Clip Earlier By Grid: NumPad -\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Clip End Earlier By Grid: Cmd+NumPad -\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Clip End Later By Grid: Cmd+NumPad +\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Clip Later By Grid: NumPad +\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Clip Start Earlier By Grid: Opt+NumPad -\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Clip Start Later By Grid: Opt+NumPad +\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Play Earlier By Grid: Control+,, ,\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Play Earlier By Next Larger Grid: Control+M, M\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Play Later By Grid: Control+., .\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Play Later By Next Larger Grid: /, Control+/\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Selection Earlier By Grid - Selection End - Selection Start: Cmd+Opt+Shift+NumPad -\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Selection Earlier By Grid - Selection End: Cmd+Shift+NumPad -\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Selection Earlier By Grid - Selection Start: Opt+Shift+NumPad -\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Selection Earlier By Grid: Shift+NumPad -\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Selection Later By Grid - Selection End - Selection Start: Cmd+Opt+Shift+NumPad +\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Selection Later By Grid - Selection End: Cmd+Shift+NumPad +\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Selection Later By Grid - Selection Start: Opt+Shift+NumPad +\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Nudge Selection Later By Grid: Shift+NumPad +\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Play Edit Selection: Control+[, Opt+[\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Play From Edit End: Control+9, 9, Cmd+Right\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Play From Edit Start: Control+7, 7, Cmd+Left\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Play Half Speed: Shift+Space\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Play Through Edit End: Cmd+Opt+Right\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Play Through Edit Start: Cmd+Opt+Left\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Play Timeline Selection: Control+], Opt+]\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Play To Edit End: Control+8, 8\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Play To Edit Start: Control+6, 6\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Play-Stop: NumPad 0, Space\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Pre Post Roll Playback: Cmd+K\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Quantize Clips: Cmd+NumPad 0, Cmd+0\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab QuickPunch: NumPad 6, Cmd+Shift+P\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Quit: Cmd+Q\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Record Arm Tracks with an Edit Selection: Shift+R\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Record Punch: F12, Cmd+Space, NumPad 3\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Redo: Shift+Control+Z, Shift+Z, Cmd+Shift+Z\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Remove Edit Insertion From Bottom Track: Opt+Control+;\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Remove Edit Insertion From Top Track: Opt+Control+P\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Rename Clips: Cmd+Opt+Shift+R\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Repeat: Opt+R\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Restore Last Selection: Cmd+Opt+Z\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Return To Zero: Return\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Save As: Cmd+Control+S\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Save: Cmd+S\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Select All: Cmd+A\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Separate Clip At Selection: B, Control+B, Cmd+E\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Shrink Edit Selection To Next Edit: Cmd+Opt+Shift+L\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Shrink Edit Selection To Previous Edit: Cmd+Opt+"\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Shuffle Mode: Opt+1, F1\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Slip Mode: F2, Opt+2\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Snap To Next: Opt+Control+.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Snap To Previous: Opt+Control+,\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Solo Tracks with an Edit Selection: Shift+S\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Space Clips: Opt+Shift+H\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Spot Mode: F3, Opt+3\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Tab to Transient: Cmd+Opt+Tab\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Time Lock Clip: Opt+Control+L\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Trim Clip End To Cursor: Opt+*, Opt+Shift+NumPad 8, S, Control+S\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Trim Clip Start To Cursor: Opt+&, A, Control+A, Opt+Shift+NumPad 7\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Trim Clip To File Boundaries: Cmd+Control+T\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Trim Clip To Selection: Cmd+T\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Trim Clips End To File End: Cmd+Control+Y\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Trim Clips Start To File Start: Cmd+Control+R\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Undo: Z, Control+Z, Cmd+Z\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Ungroup Clips: Cmd+Opt+U\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Zoom Toggle: Control+E, E\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Shortcuts are suggestions only (the Pro Tools keys) - nothing is assigned automatically. macOS names; on Windows Cmd = Ctrl, Option = Alt, Control = Win.\par}
}

