{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 PT2Reaper\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Pro Tools style editing for REAPER \u8212- one REAPER action per Pro Tools command, named after the Pro Tools command, so Pro Tools muscle memory works in REAPER.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Install (ReaPack)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Extensions > ReaPack > Import repositories\u8230 ?, paste: {\f1 https://github.com/hsuanice/PT2Reaper/raw/master/index.xml}\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab Extensions > ReaPack > Browse packages\u8230 ? > install {\b PT2Reaper}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Action List: search {\b Pro Tools}.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Everything is one package: the actions plus the shared files they need (no other package to install).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 What's inside\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Nudge} \u8212- Nudge Clip / Clip Start / Clip End / Clip Contents / Selection / Play, earlier / later, by the Nudge value (and "Next Larger"). Pro Tools Nudge presets (Measure, Min:Secs, Timecode, Feet+Frames, Samples) in the {\b Grid Nudge Panel}.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Edit selection} \u8212- Tab to Transient, Move / Extend / Shrink Edit Selection, Double / Halve Edit Selection, Link Timeline and Edit Selection.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Editing} \u8212- Separate Clip (at selection, on grid, at transients), Trim Clip, Clear, Delete Selection (partial fades kept), Repeat, Snap To Next / Previous, Space Clips, Quantize Clips, Rename Clips, Group / Ungroup, Lock, Loop, Mute.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Fades} \u8212- Create Fades, Delete Fades, Apply Next / Previous Fade Shape, crossfades.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Transport} \u8212- Play/Stop, Play Half Speed, Insertion Follows Playback, {\b QuickPunch} + {\b Record Punch} (punch in / out while playing; the pass records in the background on hidden "QP buffer" tracks, one Undo goes back to before Play).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Session} \u8212- Save, Save As, Quit, Zoom Toggle, Spot Mode.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The package's About page (ReaPack > Browse packages > PT2Reaper > About) lists every action with its Pro Tools shortcut.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Shortcuts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Nothing is bound automatically. Suggested setup: put the Pro Tools keys in an alternate keymap section (Action List > Section: {\b Main (alt-1)}) and switch with "Main action section: Toggle override to alt-1" \u8212- your own REAPER keys stay untouched.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Requirements\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab REAPER 7\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab js_ReaScriptAPI (optional): the Grid Nudge Panel gives the keyboard focus back to the arrange view after a click.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Credits\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Transport (Play/Stop, Play Half Speed, Insertion Follows Playback): behaviour modelled on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/sonictim/TJF-Scripts"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
TJF Scripts
}}}
 by Tim Farrell.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Built with AI: written with Claude Code (Anthropic); designed and tested by hsuanice.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Pro Tools is a trademark of Avid Technology, Inc. This project is not affiliated with Avid.\sa180\par}
